      "public_speaking_desc": "6 sections: foundations, structures (problem-solution-action, Pixar spine, SCQA, TED, inverted pyramid, rule of 3), slide design, delivery skills, managing nerves (~75% of adults have it), Q+A handling. Skill that compounds in value across careers.",
