      "approximate_florentine_prices_denarii_": "Approximate Florentine prices, denarii (1/240 lira). Exact prices varied across cities + over time. Source: Carlo Cipolla, \"Money in Sixteenth-Century Florence\" + comparative studies.",
      "approximate_per_book_cost_in_2026_usd_": "Approximate per-book cost in 2026 USD-equivalent. Estimates from economic history scholarship (Eltjo Buringh, Jan Luiten van Zanden — book production data 800-1800).",
