      "four_sliders_mass_speed_deceleration_c": "Four sliders: mass, speed, deceleration capability, road grade. Widget classifies braking outcome into 4 discrete states + renders SVG force diagram. No score, no reveal.",
      "four_wheel_drive_and_awd_help_with_tra": "Four-wheel drive and AWD help with traction for ACCELERATION. Braking is identical to a 2WD car — same four brakes, same tires. A false sense of security in 4WD kills people every Maine winter.",
