      "hodgdon_yachts_east_boothbay_lyman_mor": "Hodgdon Yachts (East Boothbay), Lyman-Morse (Thomaston), Sabre (Raymond), Front Street Shipyard (Belfast). Aluminum + stainless TIG primarily. Smaller crews, more variety.",
      "hold_your_breath_while_welding_the_bea": "Hold your breath while welding the bead.",
